content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Generation": {
      "objects": [
        "Plant Operator",
        "Machinery",
        "Generation Level",
        "Operational Reading",
        "Grid Controller",
        "Power Output Change",
        "Production Increase Request"
      ]
    },
    "Fueling": {
      "objects": [
        "Fuel Coordinator",
        "Fuel Usage Data",
        "Machinery",
        "Fuel Delivery"
      ]
    },
    "Inspection": {
      "objects": [
        "Maintenance Technician",
        "Safety Officer",
        "Routine Inspection",
        "Component Replacement",
        "Machinery",
        "Safety Check",
        "Hazard Report"
      ]
    },
    "subdomain connections": [
      "Generation--Fueling",
      "Generation--Inspection",
      "Fueling--Inspection"
    ]
  }
}
```
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Plant Operator",
      "description": "person running daily plant operations"
    },
    {
      "name": "Operational Reading",
      "description": "logged data showing how equipment is performing"
    },
    {
      "name": "Maintenance Technician",
      "description": "person handling inspections and repairs"
    },
    {
      "name": "Routine Inspection",
      "description": "regular check to spot wear or issues early"
    },
    {
      "name": "Component Replacement",
      "description": "swap of worn parts to keep equipment working"
    },
    {
      "name": "Machinery",
      "description": "plant equipment involved in generation and fuel use",
      "attributes": [
        "Fuel Usage Data",
        "Generation Level"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fuel Usage Data",
      "description": "info showing how much fuel the machinery consumes"
    },
    {
      "name": "Generation Level",
      "description": "current output level of the machinery"
    },
    {
      "name": "Safety Officer",
      "description": "person ensuring safety rules are followed"
    },
    {
      "name": "Safety Check",
      "description": "confirmation that conditions are safe before work"
    },
    {
      "name": "Hazard Report",
      "description": "record describing risks found in the plant"
    },
    {
      "name": "Fuel Coordinator",
      "description": "person managing fuel supply and usage"
    },
    {
      "name": "Fuel Delivery",
      "description": "scheduled shipment of fuel to the plant"
    },
    {
      "name": "Grid Controller",
      "description": "external controller requesting output changes"
    },
    {
      "name": "Production Increase Request",
      "description": "ask from the grid controller to raise output"
    },
    {
      "name": "Power Output Change",
      "description": "actual adjustment made to machinery output"
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Generation": {
      "derived from": "Generation Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Plant Operator",
        "Generator",
        "Generation Level",
        "Operational Reading",
        "Grid Controller",
        "Power Output Change",
        "Production Increase Request"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Machinery -> Generator"
      ]
    },
    "Fueling": {
      "derived from": "Fueling Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Fuel Coordinator",
        "Fuel Usage Data",
        "Unit",
        "Fuel Delivery"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Machinery -> Unit"
      ]
    },
    "Inspection": {
      "derived from": "Inspection Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Maintenance Technician",
        "Safety Officer",
        "Routine Inspection",
        "Component Replacement",
        "Machinery",
        "Safety Check",
        "Hazard Report"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    }
  }
}
```
